        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_29ffff3e749a791af2a153f39c8dc0a4ba0dc56356add78fa4aca1b82d72ed8f",
        "slc_bc1ea31a73336338eb0797d789d44d0e4d7b8b03109014628c28ee720fc75ca3",
        "slc_d501911551fed5e031a47e22018380d66f80577ecbefebac45533155cd08457b"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements are recorded as checkbox lines in `./.workflow/LEDGER.md` with open, done, and deferred-with-approval states; phases cite item numbers and discoveries are appended."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_221141e91323ad3f5b8d977e19da2261483cca88a733979c39a6ca6050ffc5cc",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb",
          "git_sha": "b652138c2c297d9ac3899b000aee062018fc76a2",
          "line_end": 48,
          "line_start": 48,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator",
          "url": "https://github.com/Rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator/blob/d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb/README.md#L48-L48"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_667d49cf1da5b60a1daf00288085f41caa8eac8f78b38423709fe5f62969cde5"
      ],
      "text": "The hook validates the `## Clarified` record by four rules: every question has an `->` answer, no `Assumption:` line, at least one answered question, and a `Branch:` line; only plain bullets count, not fenced templates or HTML comments."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_d29c7fd00cf1f945a8873a01f38024bba530442e3921b71ef287ec0234d98cd2",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "skills-patterns",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb",
          "git_sha": "b652138c2c297d9ac3899b000aee062018fc76a2",
          "line_end": 39,
          "line_start": 39,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator",
          "url": "https://github.com/Rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator/blob/d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb/README.md#L39-L39"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e086aa404fbce4bd58476c7fc90768a85be010bce0b2bf68c41ec28b23e01fcb"
      ],
      "text": "The clarify protocol in skills/clarify/SKILL.md scans seven axes (scope edge, acceptance, constraints, decision ownership, priority conflicts, existing-code contact, failure behavior) and always asks whether work lands on the current branch or a new one."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_97747af4959536a2c1c823f2d435c265e86719947054d374d2222a38276fbaf4",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb",
          "git_sha": "b652138c2c297d9ac3899b000aee062018fc76a2",
          "line_end": 73,
          "line_start": 65,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator",
          "url": "https://github.com/Rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator/blob/d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb/README.md#L65-L73"
        },
        {
          "commit": "d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb",
          "git_sha": "b652138c2c297d9ac3899b000aee062018fc76a2",
          "line_end": 63,
          "line_start": 63,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator",
          "url": "https://github.com/Rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator/blob/d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb/README.md#L63-L63"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2f580d7b84f0f617e53ecf899be48e625e5b03c5733758289fc19ea9278db332",
        "slc_5274003a214c9e7051770d0e284a00750e6eacbc369ee6a223742517ae514291"
      ],
      "text": "Behavior is configurable via env vars under `\"env\"` in ~/.claude/settings.json: a 1500-char spawn threshold, per-gate disable flags, stop-gate frequency, metrics logging, and teammate reaping settings."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_459044351bca2811a0f1dfeb503c5caa0e0326265ee2e55c37ab52d69aed1308",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb",
          "git_sha": "b652138c2c297d9ac3899b000aee062018fc76a2",
          "line_end": 73,
          "line_start": 65,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator",
          "url": "https://github.com/Rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator/blob/d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb/README.md#L65-L73"
        },
        {
          "commit": "d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb",
          "git_sha": "b652138c2c297d9ac3899b000aee062018fc76a2",
          "line_end": 75,
          "line_start": 75,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator",
          "url": "https://github.com/Rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator/blob/d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb/README.md#L75-L75"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2f580d7b84f0f617e53ecf899be48e625e5b03c5733758289fc19ea9278db332",
        "slc_e2764cf0d1f83ac66d51b9f0105e24356667266541e3f627c09f80e6fd8704d5"
      ],
      "text": "Finished teammates are reaped automatically at session end and on a rate-limited idle sweep (default 1-hour idle threshold); metrics go to ~/.claude/fable-orch/metrics.jsonl, summarized by `python3 scripts/stats.py`."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_9955ecbac2a8f4ebeaa9c17c3b54dc2ac955e614b2931da40be50086c2e95c8d",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb",
          "git_sha": "b652138c2c297d9ac3899b000aee062018fc76a2",
          "line_end": 88,
          "line_start": 87,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator",
          "url": "https://github.com/Rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator/blob/d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb/README.md#L87-L88"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d8688549b4cacb90f32d847e984562b97a47b70a51f3a97829e52bb993e67f06"
      ],
      "text": "The hooks check record shape, not question fidelity, and enforcement depends on the host's hook pipeline, so users should verify behavior on their own setup."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c791faff4a0967f3417cc22b62fdcb2e412d9073f2a123d1212a2293e6065760",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb",
          "git_sha": "b652138c2c297d9ac3899b000aee062018fc76a2",
          "line_end": 35,
          "line_start": 35,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator",
          "url": "https://github.com/Rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator/blob/d258385088a618260f8cc6fcf9486d388edacdfb/README.md#L35-L35"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_c2d1b0ee261166b52b6ad97716966d199c1fc40e59a952095fce7ba6f0624df6"
      ],
      "text": "Short spawns, forks, and teammates are never gated; a fully closed ledger from an earlier session does not disarm gates, and ledgers are retired by renaming to `LEDGER-<topic>-archive.md`."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
